er  and eventually start experiencing  visions of the Omega when that happens  the two of them can use Cage's Visions  to locate the Omega and destroy it when  Cage's visions do start he's able to use  architectural Clues to narrow the  omega's location to a dam in Germany  Cajun potaski spend countless Loops  attempting to get from the beach in  France to the dam in Germany but once  cage finally reaches his destination  he's horrified to realize the Omega  isn't there after all it turns out that  his Visions weren't a glimpse into the  omega's Consciousness but rather a  carefully laid trap the Omega showed him  exactly what it wanted him to see cage  is greeted by an alpha and a drone with  the Omega nowhere to be found while  previous mimics have killed cage the  instant they get a chance these mimics  seem to have something else in mind  instead of ripping him apart the alpha  wounds cage giving him a deep gash that  bleeds profusely cage realizes that this  is the mimic's true plan to lure him  away from his allies and then steal back  the power kept in his blood although the  visions of the dam in Germany proved to  be a red herring the Omega was still  hunkered down in Europe just in a  different country after Cajun vatasky  stopped relying on his Visions to lead  them where they needed to go they  managed to locate the Omega through a  different method using the direct link  between the Omega and Alphas to pinpoint  its location  ultimately the real Omega is located  deep beneath the Louvre in Paris France  when cage vertasky and the Rogue J Squad  arrive at the famous Museum they  discover that the area is flooded by the  same river with the Omega located  underwater the entire region is in  disarray following the mimic attacks on  Paris and the resulting floods  so while normally there's no water  underneath the Louvre in this decimated  world cage has to swim the final  distance down to the Omega  after realizing that the Visions are not  a road map to t